  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1...Dry Weather returns Monday and notably cooler.  \n\nThe cold front has cleared the area as of this writing...and with \nthe threat of severe storms having ended...have cancelled the rest \nof the Severe Thunderstorm Watch previously in effect. In the wake \nof the front...showers and a few leftover rumbles of thunder will \nwind down from northwest to southeast this evening as a much cooler \nand drier airmass settles across the Lower Lakes. With high pressure \nridging across the area Monday expect dry weather...but cool \nconditions as 850 mb temps dip into the single digits.",
